{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:07:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_94f9ca1ab20b434e98795993d94be9d2","id":"pg_021abe2d191e5f83971c54dc52c797f7","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/lidge-jun-ima2-gen-docs-docker-zh-cn-md-7fa7d426d928-54dc52c797f7.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_13b9e674e3fb55af8211fa1f35959650"],"title":"lidge-jun/ima2-gen/docs/DOCKER.zh-CN.md @ 7fa7d426d928","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:07:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_94f9ca1ab20b434e98795993d94be9d2"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0e520d86afa2cb27376e5ec9bb734a9910c9541a3b870168becf78b8e5cd9426"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The local server exposes an HTTP API at localhost:3333, including /api/capabilities, /api/models, /api/auth/switch, /api/video/generate, and prompt-builder endpoints."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2eef898f7def99b0d2c72e8b2a05a6cc7d98891a3c6e875370f34372446f16c9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The package ships three Markdown agent skills (core, frontend, UI/UX) exposed via ima2 skill commands, with listing, JSON wrappers, reference modules, and installation to an agent's skill directory."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4420ccfc6c0a91a3dc28a6872e8e168bece66baf6861cc30be9165d66df55b2c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors clone the repo, run npm install, npm run dev, npm run typecheck, npm test, and npm run build; npm run dev starts the TypeScript server with --watch and verbose diagnostics."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5adca8b2779e44ff3ad0c000c085450287a2f76b5789124b52ca540dceb371a7"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"If port 3333 is busy the server binds the next available port and records the actual URL in ~/.ima2/server.json; CLI commands follow the advertised URL, overridable via --server or IMA2_SERVER."},{"claim_ids":["clm_64871377a579f8db8ae5aff427563cb1dae60a2543f4fe9be99133d19cf578b1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product exposes a CLI (entry bin/ima2.js) with commands such as ima2 serve, setup, models, gen, video, edit, vectorize, multimode, skill, doctor, and stop."},{"claim_ids":["clm_668906c5d16123d024487e7859ce31ef90319bd0bfb919422a1a87b262282980"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"CLI generation fails closed with NO_DEFAULT_MODEL until an explicit --model/--provider or a saved default is set, to prevent upgrades from silently switching providers or billing lanes."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7e99dec95a27d557579a0b877b9b42c0c724789d4de9c66c73d05bfda83418cc"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The runtime requires Node >=22, pins npm@11.18.0, and depends on OpenAI SDK ^7.4.0 and Express ^5.1.0 per the generated runtime-install table."},{"claim_ids":["clm_84c026816ec92fad2fd804d66a572e8283e81bedbdb6ef9cd1b6fff52313f103"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"NovelAI generation is text-to-image only: reference images, edits, and masks are refused rather than silently dropped, and its edit/video surfaces are declared unsupported."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8a2b48faf72de88d0452c25cf2857fa96fc5f730f8e64c4058db1e5f694157fd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The web UI multiplexes all generation progress over a single GET /api/events SSE connection; async requests return 202 with a requestId, while legacy CLI clients without async:true still get per-request SSE streams."},{"claim_ids":["clm_da5a10718382ae1b39c451eaba587d16ca1dd0efbac06b36bc6c24404c207692"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Image generation supports multiple provider lanes: oauth (local Codex proxy), api (OpenAI Responses API), grok (xAI OAuth), grok-api (XAI_API_KEY), nai (NovelAI), agy (Antigravity CLI spawning Gemini image generation), and gemini-api."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0e520d86afa2cb27376e5ec9bb734a9910c9541a3b870168becf78b8e5cd9426","clm_2eef898f7def99b0d2c72e8b2a05a6cc7d98891a3c6e875370f34372446f16c9","clm_4420ccfc6c0a91a3dc28a6872e8e168bece66baf6861cc30be9165d66df55b2c","clm_5adca8b2779e44ff3ad0c000c085450287a2f76b5789124b52ca540dceb371a7","clm_64871377a579f8db8ae5aff427563cb1dae60a2543f4fe9be99133d19cf578b1","clm_668906c5d16123d024487e7859ce31ef90319bd0bfb919422a1a87b262282980","clm_7e99dec95a27d557579a0b877b9b42c0c724789d4de9c66c73d05bfda83418cc","clm_84c026816ec92fad2fd804d66a572e8283e81bedbdb6ef9cd1b6fff52313f103","clm_8a2b48faf72de88d0452c25cf2857fa96fc5f730f8e64c4058db1e5f694157fd","clm_da5a10718382ae1b39c451eaba587d16ca1dd0efbac06b36bc6c24404c207692"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:07:13Z","created_by_operation":"op_94f9ca1ab20b434e98795993d94be9d2","id":"pg_4c0ca213dc6d53dfb87d04707204306d","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/lidge-jun-ima2-gen-readme-md-7fa7d426d928-04707204306d.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_bbbb9ed08f74570590a79c4e070c7967"],"title":"lidge-jun/ima2-gen/README.md @ 7fa7d426d928","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:07:13Z","updated_by_operation":"op_94f9ca1ab20b434e98795993d94be9d2"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0e520d86afa2cb27376e5ec9bb734a9910c9541a3b870168becf78b8e5cd9426"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The local server exposes an HTTP API at localhost:3333, including /api/capabilities, /api/models, /api/auth/switch, /api/video/generate, and prompt-builder endpoints."},{"claim_ids":["clm_38a87917d5ee26b5e212041f5ebef9b3be9a31632702b3812b9f1a5bec87dbee"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Loopback binds run single-user with no token; non-loopback binds require IMA2_LAN_TOKEN, protecting /api and /generated with in-memory, origin-bound sessions that expire after eight hours."},{"claim_ids":["clm_84c026816ec92fad2fd804d66a572e8283e81bedbdb6ef9cd1b6fff52313f103"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"NovelAI generation is text-to-image only: reference images, edits, and masks are refused rather than silently dropped, and its edit/video surfaces are declared unsupported."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a972f6cb63c33ef32919a1680f96434409d7f268fa40adc57045ea757f00d838"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Documented provider limits: the agy lane outputs fixed 1024x1024 JPEG, allows at most 3 reference images, has no web-search/quality/size/mask controls, and does not support video (AGY_VIDEO_UNSUPPORTED)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_da5a10718382ae1b39c451eaba587d16ca1dd0efbac06b36bc6c24404c207692"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Image generation supports multiple provider lanes: oauth (local Codex proxy), api (OpenAI Responses API), grok (xAI OAuth), grok-api (XAI_API_KEY), nai (NovelAI), agy (Antigravity CLI spawning Gemini image generation), and gemini-api."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0e520d86afa2cb27376e5ec9bb734a9910c9541a3b870168becf78b8e5cd9426","clm_38a87917d5ee26b5e212041f5ebef9b3be9a31632702b3812b9f1a5bec87dbee","clm_84c026816ec92fad2fd804d66a572e8283e81bedbdb6ef9cd1b6fff52313f103","clm_a972f6cb63c33ef32919a1680f96434409d7f268fa40adc57045ea757f00d838","clm_da5a10718382ae1b39c451eaba587d16ca1dd0efbac06b36bc6c24404c207692"],"created_at":"20